WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.284
Is a prediction market contract the same thing as a casino bet?

2
00:00:00.284 --> 00:00:00.545
No—regulated event contracts settle strictly on objective,

3
00:00:00.545 --> 00:00:00.959
verifiable public facts like official NOAA weather readings or government inflation reports.

4
00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:01.261
Think of a $1.00 contract like a simple yes-or-no insurance coupon.

5
00:00:01.261 --> 00:00:01.500
If the crowd prices a 70% likely outcome at 55 cents,

6
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:01.910
buying patiently with a limit order captures a measurable mathematical margin—never chasing

7
00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:01.960
hype.

8
00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:02.194
Even a 70% probability still misses 30% of the time.

9
00:00:02.194 --> 00:00:02.608
That is why no single contract is ever allowed to risk your whole account—and why sports and

10
00:00:02.608 --> 00:00:02.743
casino-style wagers stay off-limits.
